  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 603.23 White Perch.\n\n(a) The daily limit for white perch (Morone americana) shall be 25 fish.\n\n(b) The sale of white perch shall be prohibited.\n\nSource. #10709, eff 1-1-15; ss by #10970, eff 11-9-15; ss by #14480, eff 1-13-26, EXPIRES: 1-13-36",
